        {
          "id": "2092621371914482026",
          "text": "We're shipping a cool security dashboard, but also the 𝚟𝚎𝚛𝚌𝚎𝚕 𝚜𝚎𝚌𝚞𝚛𝚒𝚝𝚢 𝚌𝚑𝚎𝚌𝚔 CLI.\n\nMuch like 𝚒𝚜-𝚊𝚐𝚎𝚗𝚝𝚒𝚌, you can call on agents to improve your security posture with human-in-the-loop, or run in crons.\n\nWho would have thunk CLIs would save the world 😁 https://t.co/xuVkD7KlHp",
